<title>USA: HA-LO in alliance with Roots Canada.</title>
<headline>HA-LO in alliance with Roots Canada.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc, which distributes specialty and premium promotional products, said Tuesday it had agreed to sell branded Roots Canada products to the corporate promotional market in the United States and Canada.</p>
<p>Toronto-based-Roots is the largest Canadian manufacturer and retailer of leather and fabric goods. There are more than 100 Roots stores in Canada, the United States, Japan, Korea, and Taiwan.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
